.\n\t\tEach point in fire drake talents also increases your fire resistance by 1%%.\n\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你召唤一阵强风，击退半径 %d 码内的敌人至多 3 格，并造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t同时，每个技能等级增加你的物理强度和命中 2 点。\n\t\t每点火龙系的技能可以使你增加火焰抗性 1%%。\n\t\t如果你装备了盾牌，这一技能也会用你的盾牌攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a41facb8754851ee9578404e7302155efd4872a4fd4d918ee385beaab3eb39f1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"767395ae1f6fc0c2c4be9dda3806f826467b5af33538fc942074b66ae1edeac2","logical_entry_identity":"f7ad44d0fd631cb8b37df16a17b15b1f779910eea8c9503713234f9a5338e78d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of trickery","source_tag":"entity name","target":"欺诈之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"78cfd35ec4c3ab749f8bc570d6f7628a4bf85f288ddfa903087cb1e3dee14135","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"767412cfcd7216e87a95bda440445ff531b2d945b2e74cb6d8e5f9a1bf8fede9","logical_entry_identity":"d317b25c3ffb3a7ad34bbd5e803895974e3e98203132a09fd361a81b1bf235b5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Please train me in the basic usage of bows and slings.","source_tag":"_t","target":"请教我弓和投石索的基础使用方法。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b73652d97e7a221cbbb58b96ecbfd162dc49318cfac20c8a0ee907cef856c2af","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"767898608e43e29a17ed092ac2e82932f708019bb66adbc4299aa79b8a98a68d","logical_entry_identity":"d8069f68632318e6c4dc49be901651c30bc28d5d9c8e29f80ad6e39b450c7608","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Massok the Dragonslayer","source_tag":"entity name","target":"弑龙者马萨克"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f8f2545716556d5faa337be2ed6b71499545bfe69f587d5baaeb69b2ac43f529","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"76789f033ff7d44770bab24b19b327e1f1a6522a7ee5e16068cf61e49cba4f90","logical_entry_identity":"0942d6f111484b3072dd6688eeb1bbb3bc7e32dca6a16b24aa205f159e58fb9d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#rng# the Caustic Terror","source_tag":"_t","